# Use an allowlist so local configuration and credentials never enter the build context.
**
!CMakeLists.txt
!core/
!core/**
!scripts/
!scripts/deploy/
!scripts/deploy/*.sh
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/.ssh/**
**/secrets/**
**/*token*
**/*TOKEN*
**/*api_key*
**/*API_KEY*
